  {
    num: "16378"
    title: "Recipe"
    description: "A cooking recipe with ingredients and steps."
    shapeIndex: 3
    mamlText: "{\n  title: \"Falafel Wrap\"\n  servings: 4\n  prep_time: \"23 minutes\"\n  cook_time: \"41 minutes\"\n\n  # Ingredients\n  ingredients: [\n    \"3 pieces kidney beans\"\n    \"4 pieces swiss chard\"\n    \"1 pieces garam masala\"\n    \"4 cups asian greens\"\n  ]\n\n  # Instructions\n  steps: [\n    \"Juicy lamb, grilled to your liking and drizzled with a bold cardamom sauce, served alongside roasted beetroot.\"\n    \"An exquisite salmon roast, infused with the essence of cavalo, slow-roasted to bring out its natural flavors and served with a side of creamy chinese cabbage\"\n    \"A sour cucumber creation, seasoned with basil and bay leaves, showcasing the best of plant-based cuisine.\"\n    \"Crispy fried pork bites, seasoned with parsley and served with a tangy aubergine dipping sauce.\"\n    \"A simple date pie. No fancy stuff. Just pie.\"\n  ]\n\n  nutrition: {\n    calories: 318\n    protein: \"37g\"\n    carbs: \"77g\"\n    fat: \"9g\"\n  }\n}"
  }
  {
    num: "16379"
    title: "Dashboard Layout"
    description: "Dashboard widget layout configuration."
    shapeIndex: 3
    mamlText: "{\n  title: \"Koch - Gleason Dashboard\"\n  refresh_interval: 60 # seconds\n  widgets: [\n    {\n      type: \"chart\"\n      title: \"Traffic\"\n      source: \"/api/metrics/traffic\"\n      chart_type: \"line\"\n      period: \"30d\"\n    }\n\n    {\n      type: \"stat\"\n      title: \"Uptime\"\n      source: \"/api/stats/revenue\"\n      format: \"percent\"\n    }\n\n    {\n      type: \"table\"\n      title: \"Recent Orders\"\n      source: \"/api/recent/orders\"\n      limit: 9\n    }\n  ]\n\n  theme: \"light\"\n}"
  }
  {
    num: "16380"
    title: "Recipe"
    description: "A cooking recipe with ingredients and steps."
    shapeIndex: 3
    mamlText: "{\n  title: \"Chicken Parm\"\n  servings: 7\n  prep_time: \"34 minutes\"\n  cook_time: \"34 minutes\"\n\n  # Ingredients\n  ingredients: [\n    \"2 tbsp redfish\"\n    \"4 pieces broccoli\"\n    \"4 pieces zucchini\"\n    \"3 pieces avocado\"\n  ]\n\n  # Instructions\n  steps: [\n    \"Juicy venison, grilled to your liking and drizzled with a bold cinnamon sauce, served alongside roasted pumpkin.\"\n    \"Fresh mixed greens tossed with curly leaf parsley-rubbed venison, cucumber, and a light dressing.\"\n    \"Tender kangaroo skewers, glazed with a sweet and tangy olive sauce, served over a bed of fragrant jasmine rice.\"\n    \"A succulent beef steak, encased in a zesty piri piri crust, served with a side of poudre de colombo mashed snowpea sprouts.\"\n    \"Hearty parmesan cheese and chicken stew, slow-cooked with anise star and french eschallots for a comforting, flavorful meal.\"\n    \"A slow-roasted Winter Wren with a smoky, crunchy exterior. Stuffed with melon and covered in aubergine sauce. Sides with purple carrot puree and wild cornichons.\"\n    \"A delightful tart combining zesty potatoes and sweet tangelo, set in a buttery pastry shell and finished with a hint of pepper.\"\n  ]\n\n  nutrition: {\n    calories: 522\n    protein: \"42g\"\n    carbs: \"46g\"\n    fat: \"13g\"\n  }\n}"
  }
  {
    num: "16381"
    title: "Git Hooks"
    description: "Git hook scripts for pre-commit and pre-push."
    shapeIndex: 4
    mamlText: "# Git hooks configuration\n{\n  # Runs before each commit\n  pre-commit: \"\"\"\n#!/bin/sh\nset -e\n\n# Run linter\nnpx eslint --fix .\n\n# Run type check\nnpx tsc --noEmit\n\n# Stage fixed files\ngit add -u\n\"\"\"\n\n  # Runs before push to remote\n  pre-push: \"\"\"\n#!/bin/sh\nset -e\n\n# Run full test suite\nnpm test\n\n# Check for console.log\nif grep -rn \"console\\.log\" src/; then\n  echo \"Error: console.log found\"\n  exit 1\nfi\n\"\"\"\n\n  # Validate commit message format\n  commit-msg: \"\"\"\n#!/bin/sh\n# Enforce conventional commit format\nif ! head -1 \"$1\" | grep -qE \"^(feat|fix|docs|style|refactor|test|chore)(\\(.+\\))?: .+\"; then\n  echo \"Error: Invalid commit message format\"\n  echo \"Use: type(scope): description\"\n  exit 1\nfi\n\"\"\"\n}"
  }
  {
    num: "16382"
    title: "Nginx Snippet"
    description: "Nginx server block as raw string configuration."
    shapeIndex: 4
    mamlText: "# Nginx configuration\n{\n  name: \"hasty-haircut.info\"\n  # Server block\n  config: \"\"\"\nserver {\n    listen 443 ssl http2;\n    server_name soupy-brief.com;\n\n    ssl_certificate /etc/ssl/certs/cert.pem;\n    ssl_certificate_key /etc/ssl/private/key.pem;\n\n    location / {\n        proxy_pass http://localhost:4779;\n        proxy_set_header Host $host;\n        proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;\n    }\n\n    location /static/ {\n        root /var/www/html;\n        expires 30d;\n    }\n}\n\"\"\"\n\n  enabled: true\n  reload_command: \"nginx -t && systemctl reload nginx\"\n}"
  }
