  {
    num: "16880"
    title: "Recipe"
    description: "A cooking recipe with ingredients and steps."
    shapeIndex: 3
    mamlText: "{\n  title: \"Barbecue Ribs\"\n  servings: 2\n  prep_time: \"19 minutes\"\n  cook_time: \"15 minutes\"\n\n  # Ingredients\n  ingredients: [\n    \"2 tsp celery\"\n    \"3 pieces oregano\"\n    \"4 tbsp freekeh\"\n    \"3 tbsp figs\"\n    \"2 tbsp potato flour\"\n  ]\n\n  # Instructions\n  steps: [\n    \"A special salmon soy sauce from Luxembourg. To support the strong flavor it is sided with a tablespoon of orange zest.\"\n    \"A delightful tart combining salty fresh chillies and sweet bush tomato, set in a buttery pastry shell and finished with a hint of kaffir leaves.\"\n    \"89-day aged ostrich steak, with choice of 2 sides.\"\n    \"Three chickory with leeks, beetroot, hijiki, broccoli and cannellini beans. With a side of baked incaberry, and your choice of chickory or mace.\"\n    \"39-day aged turkey steak, with choice of 3 sides.\"\n    \"Tender turkey skewers, glazed with a sweet and tangy orange sauce, served over a bed of fragrant jasmine rice.\"\n    \"A special green cherries from Uruguay. To support the strong flavor it is sided with a tablespoon of orange zest.\"\n  ]\n\n  nutrition: {\n    calories: 393\n    protein: \"15g\"\n    carbs: \"37g\"\n    fat: \"6g\"\n  }\n}"
  }
  {
    num: "16881"
    title: "Nginx Snippet"
    description: "Nginx server block as raw string configuration."
    shapeIndex: 4
    mamlText: "# Nginx configuration\n{\n  name: \"unimportant-rust.org\"\n  # Server block\n  config: \"\"\"\nserver {\n    listen 443 ssl http2;\n    server_name sandy-deck.org;\n\n    ssl_certificate /etc/ssl/certs/cert.pem;\n    ssl_certificate_key /etc/ssl/private/key.pem;\n\n    location / {\n        proxy_pass http://localhost:5713;\n        proxy_set_header Host $host;\n        proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;\n    }\n\n    location /static/ {\n        root /var/www/html;\n        expires 30d;\n    }\n}\n\"\"\"\n\n  enabled: true\n  reload_command: \"nginx -t && systemctl reload nginx\"\n}"
  }
